OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 10-storey student block
OL,4,Ain city
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 10-storey student accommodation block
OL,7,Fcould be built next to a Grade II
OL,8,Flisted building on the outskirts of a
OL,9,Fcity centre.
OL,11,FQuayside Exchange Land & Estates Ltd
OL,12,Fhas applied to Sunderland City Council
OL,13,Fto build the student accommodation on
OL,14,Fland between High Street East and Low
OL,15,FStreet.
OL,17,FIt would be built next to the listed
OL,18,FQuayside Exchange, a former town hall
OL,19,Fand courthouse, which the same company
OL,20,Fwants to turn into an apart-hotel.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
