OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 10-storey student block
OL,4,Ain city
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new block would have 81 one-bedroom
OL,7,Fflats and 55 self-contained studios,
OL,8,Faccording to documents submitted to the
OL,9,Fcouncil.
